From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Ericson <John.Ericson@Obsidian.Systems>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 02:21:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tools/libcompat: gather <sys/debug.h>

`common/sgsrtcid/sgsrtcid.h` includes it, and glibc has no counterpart.

Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5 (claude-opus-5)
---
 usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile b/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
index bd2a760068..f949d585f6 100644
--- a/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
+++ b/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
@@ -82,7 +82,8 @@ SYSHDRS=	sys/elf.h \
 		sys/link.h \
 		sys/machelf.h \
 		sys/secflags.h \
-		sys/procset.h
+		sys/procset.h \
+		sys/debug.h
 
 #
 # <sys/machtypes.h> is per-ISA; everything above is machine-independent.  The
